data: {"type":"toolResult","tool_result":{"call":{"provider":"call_vfw06P4VaPfGTSJ5QvpAWBMa"},"name":"search_world","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Asha's small brass key (key, object) [ID: 085fe1cd-e389-4552-bce4-9349fb8600f4]: A small brass key sewn inside Asha Pell's left coat cuff; it opens the old lens room beneath Vesper's lighthouse.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a1873c-dda9-7bf5-a8c5-094ae62ee4c8\n  - â CONCEALS from Asha Pell (person) [ID: 731a80b4-1cd1-40e2-9fe7-618d14dd3932] [Aliases: Captain Ash]: Born on Orin, Asha Pell moved to Vesper at age six and grew up there. She captains the courier ship Nightjar and belongs to the Lantern Guild; her crew usually calls her Captain Ash. She keeps a small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff; only her navigator, Iven Marr, knows she has it.\n  - â KNOWS_ABOUT from Iven Marr (person) [ID: 05ff3f16-a6a5-4f4c-833b-8f226a7a345d]: Asha Pell's navigator on the Nightjar; the only person who knows she has the small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff. He lost his right eye in the winter storm of 312. He navigates using tide charts, not magic.\n  - OPENS â Old lens room beneath Vesper's lighthouse (room, location) [ID: 287f4345-79ad-4e32-9acc-6168a9aafe18]: An old lens room beneath Vesper's tidal lighthouse, opened by Asha Pell's small brass key. A rockfall permanently sealed it in 318. Nobody has reopened it, and it has no other entrance.\n\nAsha Pell (person) [ID: 731a80b4-1cd1-40e2-9fe7-618d14dd3932] [Aliases: Captain Ash]: Born on Orin, Asha Pell moved to Vesper at age six and grew up there. She captains the courier ship Nightjar and belongs to the Lantern Guild; her crew usually calls her Captain Ash. She keeps a small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff; only her navigator, Iven Marr, knows she has it.\n  Properties: additional_source_conversation: 01a1873c-dda9-7bf5-a8c5-094ae62ee4c8; source_conversation: 01a1873c-dda9-7bf5-a8c5-094ae62ee4c8\n  - â NAVIGATES_FOR from Iven Marr (person) [ID: 05ff3f16-a6a5-4f4c-833b-8f226a7a345d]: Asha Pell's navigator on the Nightjar; the only person who knows she has the small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff. He lost his right eye in the winter storm of 312. He navigates using tide charts, not magic.\n  - CAPTAINS â Nightjar (ship, courier ship) [ID: b0cd3a42-d5b0-44dd-972d-da7d960aab40]: A courier ship captained by Asha Pell. Its former route carrying blue salt from Orin to Vesper between April and September is retired. It now carries letters from Vesper to Kest, a southern island.\n  - GREW_UP_IN â Vesper (city, port) [ID: 8e5eb323-f581-4ce1-8cf4-8bceb6847598]: Brinewake's main port city, built around a tidal lighthouse.\n  - MEMBER_OF â Lantern Guild (guild) [ID: 8ada2504-3940-4fa0-9142-7b15d6e2c8fa]: The guild that maintains Vesper's tidal lighthouse and buys blue salt from Orin's miners; it does not own the mines. When the strait freezes in winter, the guild uses stored blue salt.\n  - CONCEALS â Asha's small brass key (key, object) [ID: 085fe1cd-e389-4552-bce4-9349fb8600f4]: A small brass key sewn inside Asha Pell's left coat cuff; it opens the old lens room beneath Vesper's lighthouse.\n  - TRUSTS_WITH â Iven Marr (person) [ID: 05ff3f16-a6a5-4f4c-833b-8f226a7a345d]: Asha Pell's navigator on the Nightjar; the only person who knows she has the small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff. He lost his right eye in the winter storm of 312. He navigates using tide charts, not magic.\n  - DOES_NOT_ALLOW_TO_NEGOTIATE â Iven Marr (person) [ID: 05ff3f16-a6a5-4f4c-833b-8f226a7a345d]: Asha Pell's navigator on the Nightjar; the only person who knows she has the small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff. He lost his right eye in the winter storm of 312. He navigates using tide charts, not magic.\n  - BORN_IN â Orin (island) [ID: 9bac8802-f464-491c-b86e-9c90ec862af2]: An island where blue salt is mined.\n\nOld lens room beneath Vesper's lighthouse (room, location) [ID: 287f4345-79ad-4e32-9acc-6168a9aafe18]: An old lens room beneath Vesper's tidal lighthouse, opened by Asha Pell's small brass key. A rockfall permanently sealed it in 318. Nobody has reopened it, and it has no other entrance.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a1873c-dda9-7bf5-a8c5-094ae62ee4c8\n  - â OPENS from Asha's small brass key (key, object) [ID: 085fe1cd-e389-4552-bce4-9349fb8600f4]: A small brass key sewn inside Asha Pell's left coat cuff; it opens the old lens room beneath Vesper's lighthouse.\n  - LOCATED_BENEATH â Tidal lighthouse of Vesper (lighthouse) [ID: 76dc2022-8211-4657-b177-03c04d118558]: A tidal lighthouse around which Vesper is built. Its lenses run on blue salt.\n\nIven Marr (person) [ID: 05ff3f16-a6a5-4f4c-833b-8f226a7a345d]: Asha Pell's navigator on the Nightjar; the only person who knows she has the small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff. He lost his right eye in the winter storm of 312. He navigates using tide charts, not magic.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a1873c-dda9-7bf5-a8c5-094ae62ee4c8\n  - â TRUSTS_WITH from Asha Pell (person) [ID: 731a80b4-1cd1-40e2-9fe7-618d14dd3932] [Aliases: Captain Ash]: Born on Orin, Asha Pell moved to Vesper at age six and grew up there. She captains the courier ship Nightjar and belongs to the Lantern Guild; her crew usually calls her Captain Ash. She keeps a small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff; only her navigator, Iven Marr, knows she has it.\n  - â DOES_NOT_ALLOW_TO_NEGOTIATE from Asha Pell (person) [ID: 731a80b4-1cd1-40e2-9fe7-618d14dd3932] [Aliases: Captain Ash]: Born on Orin, Asha Pell moved to Vesper at age six and grew up there. She captains the courier ship Nightjar and belongs to the Lantern Guild; her crew usually calls her Captain Ash. She keeps a small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff; only her navigator, Iven Marr, knows she has it.\n  - NAVIGATES_FOR â Asha Pell (person) [ID: 731a80b4-1cd1-40e2-9fe7-618d14dd3932] [Aliases: Captain Ash]: Born on Orin, Asha Pell moved to Vesper at age six and grew up there. She captains the courier ship Nightjar and belongs to the Lantern Guild; her crew usually calls her Captain Ash. She keeps a small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff; only her navigator, Iven Marr, knows she has it.\n  - KNOWS_ABOUT â Asha's small brass key (key, object) [ID: 085fe1cd-e389-4552-bce4-9349fb8600f4]: A small brass key sewn inside Asha Pell's left coat cuff; it opens the old lens room beneath Vesper's lighthouse.\n  - NAVIGATES â Nightjar (ship, courier ship) [ID: b0cd3a42-d5b0-44dd-972d-da7d960aab40]: A courier ship captained by Asha Pell. Its former route carrying blue salt from Orin to Vesper between April and September is retired. It now carries letters from Vesper to Kest, a southern island.\n\nNightjar (ship, courier ship) [ID: b0cd3a42-d5b0-44dd-972d-da7d960aab40]: A courier ship captained by Asha Pell. Its former route carrying blue salt from Orin to Vesper between April and September is retired. It now carries letters from Vesper to Kest, a southern island.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a1873c-dda9-7bf5-a8c5-094ae62ee4c8\n  - â CAPTAINS from Asha Pell (person) [ID: 731a80b4-1cd1-40e2-9fe7-618d14dd3932] [Aliases: Captain Ash]: Born on Orin, Asha Pell moved to Vesper at age six and grew up there. She captains the courier ship Nightjar and belongs to the Lantern Guild; her crew usually calls her Captain Ash. She keeps a small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff; only her navigator, Iven Marr, knows she has it.\n  - â NAVIGATES from Iven Marr (person) [ID: 05ff3f16-a6a5-4f4c-833b-8f226a7a345d]: Asha Pell's navigator on the Nightjar; the only person who knows she has the small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff. He lost his right eye in the winter storm of 312. He navigates using tide charts, not magic.\n  - CARRIES_LETTERS_TO â Kest (island) [ID: bad6adf5-46ea-4e4e-9cb5-03059da8b067]: A southern island."}]}}

